# Wave W17-V (Heritage Forest): deep turf — deep shade green: the darkest ground in Borea, a low forest green carrying sparse coin-light flecks where the canopy lets a coin of light through to the floor (design: deep shade, soft ground; the forest keeps a spare of everything). The forest’s own ground — split from Meadowbrook Woods’ bright silk-shade turf (Maris) by value entire (manor dark vs silk bright) and from every Borea route turf by the coin-light: no open road wears this dark.
